# Authorization

### Authorization login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

{
	"username": "{{user}}",
	"password": "{{pass}}"
}
###

### Authorization Refresh Token

POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

{
	"refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

